   "Joinable pairs refused as scene_changed, in both arms, all in the courtyards: held-courtyard-111-p1 (1, 2), held-courtyard-112-s3 (1, 2) and held-courtyard-112-m1 (0, 1) and (1, 2), with 4.4 to 10.5 percent (exif) and 3.1 to 9.3 percent (perturbed) of the compared view disagreeing where nothing changed; their cause is not established here. The perturbed arm also refused held-landscape-311-c3 (1, 2) as moved_between_photographs, 5 of 129 in all.",
