  "profile_note": "Outcome of the standpoint join's pre-registered measurement on the held-out split, made once with the frozen method in both arms.",
  "verdict": "PASSED EVERY PRE-REGISTERED GATE IN BOTH ARMS. No pair of photographs taken metres apart and no pair across a change was ever joined. Joined photographs lined up from the standpoint to within 0.34 degrees (exif) and 0.41 degrees (exif-perturbed) at the 95th percentile beyond the parallax their own movement made, 0.87 and 0.92 degrees at worst; their depths agreed at the hand-over to a median of 2.4 percent. 63 of 86 joinable pairs sharing a fifth of the view were joined, and 4 (5 perturbed) of 129 joinable pairs were refused as changed or moved when they were neither."
